# Copixi — Environment Variables
# AGENTS.md §10: Never expose API keys in frontend (no VITE_ prefix)
# This file is safe to commit. Copy to .env.local for local dev and fill secrets.

# Server-only (Vercel Environment Variables)
# Used exclusively in api/chat.ts (Vercel Function) — never in client code
# Primary model: Gemini. If absent or failing, Groq then OpenRouter are used as fallback.
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Optional: Groq fallback (https://console.groq.com). OpenAI-compatible API,
# rápido y con tier gratuito. Se usa si Gemini falta o falla.
GROQ_API_KEY=

# Optional: OpenRouter fallback (https://openrouter.ai). Enables OpenAI-compatible models
# when GEMINI_API_KEY is not set.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# Optional: deployment
# VERCEL_URL is auto-injected by Vercel
